sequenceDiagram
 actor U as Owner
 participant A as Estimate service
 participant B as Commercial catalog
 participant D as Result store
 U->>A: Explicit refresh(baseline,scope revision,key)
 A->>D: Authorize/read original snapshot
 A->>B: Resolve approved current book
 B-->>A: Exact version/rates
 A->>A: Recalculate active scope,price,schedule/team if affected
 A->>D: New immutable revision linked to baseline
 A-->>U: Old/new versions,delta,validity and unresolved
